01#c7394499698068434970' title=''/><author><name>liberranter</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00555275410576294081</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-police-useless-but-not-harmless.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-468434957683823864' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/468434957683823864' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-529179912"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 1, 2012 at 4:25 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4423212558264885431</id><published>2012-08-01T14:25:42.235-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-01T14:25:42.235-06:00</updated><title type='text'>When the police don&amp;#39;t do their jobs, the publi...</title><content type='html'>When the police don&amp;#39;t do their jobs, the public eventually starts to take the law into their own hands.  And despite NYC Mayor Blowhard&amp;#39;s wishes, even if there were no more guns except in the hands of cops, the people would still take matters into their own hands.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;At this point, main street America would probably be better off with vigilante justice than the protection of their local &amp;quot;finest&amp;quot;.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/468434957683823864/comments/default/4423212558264885431'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/468434957683823864/comments/default/4423212558264885431'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-police-useless-but-not-harmless.html?showComment=1343852742235#c4423212558264885431' title=''/><author><name>swiftfoxmark2</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/05065756739868968717</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/_TJ3_eIM9T0A/SdYjl4zvpkI/AAAAAAAAABk/Oz9qVIQm4T8/S220/greenbutterfly.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-police-useless-but-not-harmless.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-468434957683823864' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/468434957683823864' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1363008913"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 1, 2012 at 2:25 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3743464612885164482</id><published>2012-08-01T13:50:14.943-06:00</published><updated>2012-08-01T13:50:14.943-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will, you&amp;#39;ve once again stated the sadly obvio...</title><content type='html'>Will, you&amp;#39;ve once again stated the sadly obvious: No cops would be a blessing.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/468434957683823864/comments/default/3743464612885164482'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/468434957683823864/comments/default/3743464612885164482'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-police-useless-but-not-harmless.html?showComment=1343850614943#c3743464612885164482' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/08/the-police-useless-but-not-harmless.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-468434957683823864' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/468434957683823864' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1586870221"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 1, 2012 at 1:50 PM"/></entry></feed>